+// KAIAIR_DL_SINR_CSI=1 the patched OAI UE sends a custom 10-bit payload in place of the standard CSI, 
 // LSB-first packed (bits 0-4 = quantized PDSCH-data RSSI, bits 5-9 = quantized interference) and
